1
00:00:53,160 --> 00:00:54,440
My mother's prescription

2
00:00:54,440 --> 00:00:55,560
is really complicated.

3
00:00:55,560 --> 00:00:57,820
I finally gathered all the ingredients.

4
00:01:05,800 --> 00:01:06,520
Oh no,

5
00:01:06,720 --> 00:01:07,400
not again.

6
00:01:10,680 --> 00:01:11,760
We can talk

7
00:01:12,160 --> 00:01:13,360
about this!

8
00:01:13,720 --> 00:01:14,600
Help!

9
00:01:51,080 --> 00:01:51,560
Stay

10
00:01:51,720 --> 00:01:52,600
away!

11
00:01:57,080 --> 00:01:57,960
No!

12
00:01:58,240 --> 00:02:00,200
Actor Xia Yimo

13
00:02:04,160 --> 00:02:04,960
You're awake.

14
00:02:06,120 --> 00:02:07,040
Take it easy.

15
00:02:08,240 --> 00:02:08,900
Be careful.

16
00:02:13,080 --> 00:02:13,940
How do you feel?

17
00:02:21,320 --> 00:02:22,320
How did I get here?

18
00:02:28,040 --> 00:02:29,079
Where are you going?

19
00:02:29,079 --> 00:02:30,320
Your wounds have not healed yet.

20
00:02:30,320 --> 00:02:31,980
Where are you going, Ying'er?

21
00:02:38,720 --> 00:02:39,450
Ning Yuanci!

22
00:02:59,800 --> 00:03:00,640
How are you?

23
00:03:01,240 --> 00:03:02,160
Are you hurt?

24
00:03:03,560 --> 00:03:04,160
Let me see.

25
00:03:12,040 --> 00:03:12,570
I am fine.

26
00:03:16,560 --> 00:03:17,560
It is my fault.

27
00:03:19,680 --> 00:03:21,810
I did not apply medicine to your wound.

28
00:03:23,320 --> 00:03:25,120
My mother's healing salve
is very effective.

29
00:03:25,120 --> 00:03:26,579
I will go get it for you now.

30
00:03:30,320 --> 00:03:31,079
I... you...

31
00:03:34,480 --> 00:03:35,540
You're Xue Keying,

32
00:03:36,240 --> 00:03:36,680
right?

33
00:03:38,240 --> 00:03:39,200
Or are you

34
00:03:41,760 --> 00:03:42,160
Xia

35
00:03:44,160 --> 00:03:44,600
Mo?

36
00:03:47,560 --> 00:03:47,960
You...

37
00:03:48,480 --> 00:03:49,680
You know everything.

38
00:03:54,600 --> 00:03:55,660
What are you doing?

39
00:03:56,360 --> 00:03:57,360
Ying'er is awake.

40
00:03:57,520 --> 00:03:58,360
I need to go back and save her.

41
00:03:58,360 --> 00:03:59,720
If you don't want Xue Keying

42
00:03:59,720 --> 00:04:00,920
to be in danger again,

43
00:04:01,200 --> 00:04:02,200
let me finish.

44
00:04:05,200 --> 00:04:05,800
I know

45
00:04:06,200 --> 00:04:07,840
you've always been harsh and cruel to me,

46
00:04:07,840 --> 00:04:08,600
but I believe

47
00:04:08,840 --> 00:04:10,640
you truly care about Xue Keying.

48
00:04:10,960 --> 00:04:12,720
If you really want what's best for her,

49
00:04:12,720 --> 00:04:13,650
when you go back.

50
00:04:13,880 --> 00:04:14,680
don't say a word

51
00:04:14,680 --> 00:04:15,640
to Xue Shiyan

52
00:04:18,040 --> 00:04:19,899
Who would believe your nonsense?

53
00:04:20,000 --> 00:04:21,320
Who knows what you and Ning Yuanci

54
00:04:21,320 --> 00:04:22,050
are plotting

55
00:04:22,079 --> 00:04:23,400
against my Ying'er?

56
00:04:24,440 --> 00:04:25,300
Let me tell you,

57
00:04:25,800 --> 00:04:27,680
the master loves Ying'er the most.

58
00:04:27,680 --> 00:04:29,400
I'm going back right now to tell him

59
00:04:29,400 --> 00:04:30,320
that you hid

60
00:04:30,320 --> 00:04:31,120
Ying'er.

61
00:04:31,880 --> 00:04:32,840
Just you wait.

62
00:04:34,040 --> 00:04:35,840
Xue Shiyan doesn't love anyone.

63
00:04:36,720 --> 00:04:38,320
He only cares about himself.

64
00:04:38,720 --> 00:04:40,240
He could sacrifice my mother's life

65
00:04:40,240 --> 00:04:41,170
and my marriage.

66
00:04:42,200 --> 00:04:42,860
Do you think

67
00:04:43,600 --> 00:04:45,460
Xue Keying would be an exception?

68
00:04:52,240 --> 00:04:52,880
I seem

69
00:04:54,159 --> 00:04:55,690
to have entered your dream.

70
00:04:56,560 --> 00:04:57,960
That was a strange place.

71
00:04:59,560 --> 00:05:00,040
And

72
00:05:01,120 --> 00:05:01,640
I saw you

73
00:05:02,520 --> 00:05:03,360
die in front of me

74
00:05:03,360 --> 00:05:04,800
over and over again.

75
00:05:05,320 --> 00:05:06,320
I also saw someone

76
00:05:06,320 --> 00:05:07,960
who looked exactly like Xue Ruowan.

77
00:05:07,960 --> 00:05:09,290
She called you Xia Yimo.

78
00:05:10,600 --> 00:05:11,400
Can you tell me

79
00:05:11,560 --> 00:05:12,960
what exactly is going on?

80
00:05:15,120 --> 00:05:16,000
It's

81
00:05:17,880 --> 00:05:18,940
a bit complicated.

82
00:05:19,960 --> 00:05:21,680
It's hard for me to explain.

83
00:05:25,120 --> 00:05:26,320
It's all Xuyu's fault

84
00:05:26,600 --> 00:05:28,600
for making the plot so complicated.

85
00:05:30,440 --> 00:05:31,120
Xue Keying,

86
00:05:31,640 --> 00:05:33,200
you caused this mess,

87
00:05:33,760 --> 00:05:34,960
yet you blame it on me.

88
00:05:35,680 --> 00:05:36,210
Who is it?

89
00:05:37,000 --> 00:05:38,530
Ning Yuanci can hear it too.

90
00:05:38,680 --> 00:05:39,680
He can hear it

91
00:05:39,800 --> 00:05:40,680
if I want him to.

92
00:05:42,080 --> 00:05:43,360
Damn Xuyu.

93
00:05:44,480 --> 00:05:46,240
I did everything you said,

94
00:05:47,240 --> 00:05:48,920
but Xue Ruowan still got hurt.

95
00:05:49,320 --> 00:05:50,720
You're just a big liar.

96
00:05:50,800 --> 00:05:51,930
You pretend to obey,

97
00:05:52,320 --> 00:05:53,840
but deep down you've been resisting

98
00:05:53,840 --> 00:05:54,900
and fighting back.

99
00:05:55,080 --> 00:05:56,360
The change in your character setting

100
00:05:56,360 --> 00:05:58,360
affected the will of other characters,

101
00:05:58,360 --> 00:06:00,560
causing the original plot to misalign.

102
00:06:00,720 --> 00:06:01,920
That's what almost led to

103
00:06:01,920 --> 00:06:03,320
an irreversible ending.

104
00:06:03,360 --> 00:06:03,960
Keying,

105
00:06:04,760 --> 00:06:05,690
what's going on?

106
00:06:09,680 --> 00:06:10,480
And you even dragged Ning Yuanci

107
00:06:10,480 --> 00:06:11,400
into this.

108
00:06:11,760 --> 00:06:13,020
Making us swap bodies,

109
00:06:13,240 --> 00:06:14,160
how could you come up with that?

110
00:06:14,160 --> 00:06:15,840
There was no body-swapping plot

111
00:06:15,840 --> 00:06:17,100
in the Mo Xiang script.

112
00:06:17,200 --> 00:06:19,160
It's a small loophole created
when I asked the writer to fix

113
00:06:19,160 --> 00:06:20,520
the main storyline.

114
00:06:20,800 --> 00:06:21,330
However,

115
00:06:21,720 --> 00:06:23,000
I saw you and Ning Yuanci

116
00:06:23,000 --> 00:06:25,080
bound by fate

117
00:06:25,520 --> 00:06:26,960
and connected in mind
at the moment of life and death.

118
00:06:26,960 --> 00:06:28,360
It's quite interesting.

119
00:06:28,920 --> 00:06:29,920
Interesting.

120
00:06:31,480 --> 00:06:32,240
Are the lives of characters

121
00:06:32,240 --> 00:06:33,280
not lives?

122
00:06:33,920 --> 00:06:35,080
We almost died.

123
00:06:35,080 --> 00:06:36,400
You gave Ning Yuanci

124
00:06:36,440 --> 00:06:38,800
awareness and emotions beyond the script.

125
00:06:38,800 --> 00:06:40,480
How will you complete

126
00:06:40,520 --> 00:06:41,720
the plot missions next

127
00:06:41,720 --> 00:06:43,600
and reach the grand finale of the story?

128
00:06:43,600 --> 00:06:45,280
I'm really looking forward to it.

129
00:06:45,280 --> 00:06:46,040
Good luck,

130
00:06:46,360 --> 00:06:46,880
Xue Keying.

131
00:06:46,880 --> 00:06:47,680
Is this my last

132
00:06:47,680 --> 00:06:48,400
chance?

133
00:06:50,800 --> 00:06:52,000
Say something.

134
00:07:00,160 --> 00:07:01,220
It's getting late.

135
00:07:01,480 --> 00:07:02,800
I-I have to go back

136
00:07:02,840 --> 00:07:03,920
and fool Xue Shiyan.

137
00:07:03,920 --> 00:07:05,440
I'll explain it to you later.

138
00:07:05,440 --> 00:07:05,970
Don't go.

139
00:07:12,920 --> 00:07:14,080
I really have to go.

140
00:07:15,000 --> 00:07:17,400
Otherwise Xue Shiyan will get suspicious.

141
00:07:17,560 --> 00:07:19,160
You're not going anywhere

142
00:07:20,640 --> 00:07:22,440
until you explain it to me today.

143
00:07:33,120 --> 00:07:34,280
If I say

144
00:07:35,600 --> 00:07:37,200
I don't belong to this world,

145
00:07:38,920 --> 00:07:39,920
and this world isn't

146
00:07:39,920 --> 00:07:41,050
what you think it is,

147
00:07:41,159 --> 00:07:42,360
would you believe me?

148
00:07:43,880 --> 00:07:44,680
I believe you.

149
00:07:46,760 --> 00:07:48,490
I don't care where you're from.

150
00:07:49,000 --> 00:07:50,120
What I care about is

151
00:07:51,560 --> 00:07:53,360
whether the person in front of me

152
00:07:53,920 --> 00:07:54,760
has ever

153
00:07:54,760 --> 00:07:55,800
truly liked me.

154
00:07:57,520 --> 00:07:59,120
You said you liked me before,

155
00:07:59,560 --> 00:08:00,620
but it was all fake,

156
00:08:01,880 --> 00:08:02,320
right?

157
00:08:03,160 --> 00:08:03,720
No.

158
00:08:05,440 --> 00:08:06,440
That's not right.

159
00:08:06,920 --> 00:08:08,280
I was acting,

160
00:08:08,560 --> 00:08:09,000
but...

161
00:08:11,360 --> 00:08:12,440
What am I saying?

162
00:08:12,600 --> 00:08:13,000
Okay.

163
00:08:14,560 --> 00:08:15,080
I know.

164
00:08:19,200 --> 00:08:20,460
You don't understand.

165
00:08:21,400 --> 00:08:22,560
I really do like you.

166
00:08:23,320 --> 00:08:25,280
You can't fake true feelings.

167
00:08:26,000 --> 00:08:27,730
You should be able to feel that.

168
00:08:28,600 --> 00:08:29,360
You asked me

169
00:08:30,120 --> 00:08:31,320
if I was Xue Keying.

170
00:08:31,880 --> 00:08:32,760
I am her,

171
00:08:34,880 --> 00:08:36,360
but not entirely.

172
00:08:37,880 --> 00:08:38,520
I don't even know

173
00:08:38,520 --> 00:08:39,919
how to explain it to you.

174
00:08:52,560 --> 00:08:53,600
What you just said

175
00:08:53,600 --> 00:08:54,200
is enough.

176
00:08:55,960 --> 00:08:58,040
As for the plot

177
00:08:59,000 --> 00:09:00,600
and tasks

178
00:09:01,160 --> 00:09:02,280
the system mentioned,

179
00:09:02,280 --> 00:09:03,340
they don't matter.

180
00:09:04,040 --> 00:09:05,300
The important thing is

181
00:09:06,080 --> 00:09:06,600
I know

182
00:09:07,560 --> 00:09:08,480
you like me.

183
00:09:31,720 --> 00:09:32,400
Xue Keying,

184
00:09:36,280 --> 00:09:36,940
Xue Ruowan,

185
00:09:41,000 --> 00:09:41,800
What's wrong?

186
00:09:42,480 --> 00:09:43,200
Even though

187
00:09:44,080 --> 00:09:44,760
I know

188
00:09:44,880 --> 00:09:45,960
it's too late,

189
00:09:46,120 --> 00:09:47,720
I still want to say I'm sorry.

190
00:09:48,040 --> 00:09:49,800
I shouldn't have acted on my own.

191
00:09:49,800 --> 00:09:51,130
I almost got you killed.

192
00:09:52,840 --> 00:09:55,100
There's no need to keep score between us.

193
00:09:56,720 --> 00:09:59,200
Actually,

194
00:09:59,520 --> 00:10:00,520
I've remembered a lot

195
00:10:00,520 --> 00:10:02,120
about our childhood lately.

196
00:10:02,280 --> 00:10:03,440
Our childhood?

197
00:10:05,440 --> 00:10:06,840
Sister, play with me.

198
00:10:07,440 --> 00:10:08,200
Sister,

199
00:10:08,840 --> 00:10:10,680
play with me.

200
00:10:13,600 --> 00:10:14,320
Come here.

201
00:10:14,760 --> 00:10:16,420
I've held a grudge against you

202
00:10:16,480 --> 00:10:17,680
since we were little.

203
00:10:19,120 --> 00:10:20,080
But I forgot

204
00:10:20,680 --> 00:10:21,720
that I was the one who coldly

205
00:10:21,720 --> 00:10:22,980
pushed you away first.

206
00:10:23,760 --> 00:10:24,400
Because I was jealous

207
00:10:24,400 --> 00:10:26,400
of the love you got from our parents,

208
00:10:26,560 --> 00:10:27,280
I treated you

209
00:10:27,280 --> 00:10:28,240
as an enemy.

210
00:10:29,320 --> 00:10:32,160
Later, when you opened your heart to me,

211
00:10:32,680 --> 00:10:33,480
I thought

212
00:10:33,760 --> 00:10:35,200
you were just pitying me.

213
00:10:36,560 --> 00:10:38,680
Sometimes I longed to be

214
00:10:38,680 --> 00:10:40,140
a truly good sister to you,

215
00:10:40,680 --> 00:10:41,610
but other times,

216
00:10:42,640 --> 00:10:43,400
I wished

217
00:10:43,560 --> 00:10:45,020
you were just a bad person.

218
00:10:45,520 --> 00:10:46,920
That way, I would be the only one

219
00:10:46,920 --> 00:10:47,960
getting hurt.

220
00:10:50,520 --> 00:10:51,520
Growing up,

221
00:10:52,200 --> 00:10:53,800
I haven't been a good sister.

222
00:10:55,280 --> 00:10:56,340
Can you forgive me?

223
00:10:58,000 --> 00:10:59,400
When we get famous later,

224
00:10:59,440 --> 00:11:00,170
we can become

225
00:11:00,200 --> 00:11:01,320
international superstars.

226
00:11:01,320 --> 00:11:03,050
Then we'll act in the same show.

227
00:11:03,080 --> 00:11:03,960
and go down in cinematic history.

228
00:11:03,960 --> 00:11:04,960
Then who plays the lead

229
00:11:04,960 --> 00:11:06,280
and who plays the supporting role?

230
00:11:06,280 --> 00:11:07,200
We'll be co-leads.

231
00:11:07,200 --> 00:11:08,320
Co-leads?

232
00:11:08,480 --> 00:11:09,400
As if we'd ever

233
00:11:09,400 --> 00:11:10,200
be that lucky.

234
00:11:10,360 --> 00:11:11,000
Just because it hasn't happened yet

235
00:11:11,000 --> 00:11:12,260
doesn't mean it won't.

236
00:11:12,400 --> 00:11:13,660
As long as we work hard,

237
00:11:13,760 --> 00:11:15,360
we will definitely succeed.

238
00:11:20,320 --> 00:11:21,850
Actually, I'm at fault too.

239
00:11:22,040 --> 00:11:23,770
I often acted self-righteous,

240
00:11:23,800 --> 00:11:25,560
thinking it was for your own good,

241
00:11:25,560 --> 00:11:27,160
but I ignored your feelings.

242
00:11:29,000 --> 00:11:30,400
Even knowing that things

243
00:11:30,520 --> 00:11:31,850
weren't what I thought,

244
00:11:32,720 --> 00:11:34,380
I still picked fights with you

245
00:11:34,600 --> 00:11:36,330
and refused to clear things up.

246
00:11:38,320 --> 00:11:39,580
I wanted to get closer,

247
00:11:40,560 --> 00:11:42,420
but I used the worst possible way.

248
00:11:43,120 --> 00:11:43,640
I...

249
00:11:48,160 --> 00:11:48,960
From now on,

250
00:11:49,280 --> 00:11:50,610
just stay where you are.

251
00:11:51,560 --> 00:11:53,220
Let me be the one to come to you.

252
00:12:06,040 --> 00:12:06,770
Don't worry.

253
00:12:07,200 --> 00:12:09,120
No matter how many times we start over,

254
00:12:09,120 --> 00:12:10,980
I will never give up on saving you.

255
00:12:18,560 --> 00:12:19,400
But right now,

256
00:12:20,080 --> 00:12:20,880
I must earn

257
00:12:20,920 --> 00:12:22,050
Xue Shiyan's trust.

258
00:12:23,560 --> 00:12:24,080
I might

259
00:12:24,480 --> 00:12:26,640
have to become the person you hate again.

260
00:12:26,640 --> 00:12:27,640
Putting on an act...

261
00:12:27,640 --> 00:12:28,680
isn't that

262
00:12:28,720 --> 00:12:30,080
what you're best at, silly girl?

263
00:12:30,080 --> 00:12:31,120
As long as I know

264
00:12:31,280 --> 00:12:32,480
who you truly are, that's enough.
